    {
      "id": "wf01-sequential",
      "order": 201,
      "section": "workflows",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Sequential / Prompt Chaining"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "一次调用同时研究、起草、校验和润色，提示词会承担过多目标，任何局部错误也难以定位。Sequential 把稳定任务拆成有顺序、有契约的阶段。"
      },
      "url": "zh/01-workflows/wf01-sequential/",
      "urls": {
        "zh-CN": "zh/01-workflows/wf01-sequential/"
      },
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-24"
    },
    {
      "id": "wf02-routing",
      "order": 202,
      "section": "workflows",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Routing"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "不同请求需要不同能力与政策，却都进入同一提示词，导致上下文臃肿、答案不稳定。Routing 先判断类别，再选择有限分支。"
      },
      "url": "zh/01-workflows/wf02-routing/",
      "urls": {
        "zh-CN": "zh/01-workflows/wf02-routing/"
      },
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-24"
    },
    {
      "id": "wf03-parallel",
      "order": 203,
      "section": "workflows",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Parallelization / Fan-out Fan-in"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "多个互不依赖的子任务串行执行会放大等待；单一回答也可能缺少多视角覆盖。Parallelization 同时运行独立工作，再合并结果。"
      },
      "url": "zh/01-workflows/wf03-parallel/",
      "urls": {
        "zh-CN": "zh/01-workflows/wf03-parallel/"
      },
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-24"
    },
    {
      "id": "wf04-evaluator",
      "order": 204,
      "section": "workflows",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Evaluator–Optimizer"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "一次生成很难稳定满足可明确检查的质量标准，但让生成器无限自我修改又会循环。Evaluator–Optimizer 把生成和评价分离，并设置有界反馈回路。"
      },
      "url": "zh/01-workflows/wf04-evaluator/",
      "urls": {
        "zh-CN": "zh/01-workflows/wf04-evaluator/"
      },
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-24"
    },
    {
      "id": "wf05-composition",
      "order": 205,
      "section": "workflows",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Workflow Composition：Branch、Join、Loop 与 Fallback"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "真实产品不是单一 pattern，而是线性步骤、条件分支、并行汇合、有界循环与降级的组合。缺少组合语义会让错误路径成为隐式代码。"
      },
      "url": "zh/01-workflows/wf05-composition/",
      "urls": {
        "zh-CN": "zh/01-workflows/wf05-composition/"
      },
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-24"
    },
    {
      "id": "wf06-comparison",
      "order": 206,
      "section": "workflows",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Workflow vs Agent"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "Workflow 稳定但覆盖有限，Agent 灵活但不确定。团队需要基于任务证据选择，而不是把 Agent 当作默认升级方向。"
      },
      "url": "zh/01-workflows/wf06-comparison/",
      "urls": {
        "zh-CN": "zh/01-workflows/wf06-comparison/"
