    },
    {
      "id": "sa02-loop",
      "order": 302,
      "section": "single-agent",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Reason–Act–Observe Loop"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "只画一个圆环无法实现可运营 Agent：必须明确每轮读取什么、产出什么、谁执行、状态何时提交。"
