      "id": "sa03-reflection",
      "order": 303,
      "section": "single-agent",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Reflection / Self-Critique"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "Agent 完成后可能遗漏约束或未利用已有证据。Reflection 在最终提交前重新检查轨迹与候选结果。"
      },
      "url": "zh/02-single-agent/sa03-reflection/",
