      "order": 304,
      "section": "single-agent",
      "status": "planned",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "Critic and Revision"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "生成者容易重复自己的盲点。独立 Critic 用不同指令、上下文或模型评价候选，再由 Reviser 定向修改。"
